state phase_bounce_more "The core bounces free (the Flare Dancer has health to spare)" in enemy at 2040 80
state phase_run_more "The core runs circles (the Flare Dancer has health to spare)" in enemy at 2180 80
state timer_run_more "The core runs circles (the Flare Dancer has health to spare): beats left" in enemy at 2040 150
state phase_bounce_last "The core bounces free (the Flare Dancer's last core)" in enemy at 2040 220
state phase_run_last "The core runs circles (the Flare Dancer's last core)" in enemy at 2180 220
state timer_run_last "The core runs circles (the Flare Dancer's last core): beats left" in enemy at 2040 290
